s, Handmade Coffee Cups for Cocoa, Coffee and Tea"}, "classifications": {"productGroup": {"displayValue": "Ceramic Tea Set"}}, "byLineInfo": {"brand": {"displayValue": "Verve CULTURE"}}}, "browseNodeInfo": {"browseNodes": [{"id": "1001", "displayName": "Ceramic Tea Set"}]}, "offersV2": {"listings": [{"price": {"money": {"amount": 20.0, "currency": "USD"}}}]}, "customerReviews": {"starRating": 4.8, "count": 9.0}, "description": "In order to get the full experience of Mexican Hot Chocolate, you need to ensure the chocolate is made in Oaxaca, froth and mix with a traditional molinillo, and sip out of a clay barro cup. This set of 2 handmade ceramic mugs are simple in design, with a lovely glaze coating the inside and lip of each cup to help mitigate condensation."}, {"asin": "B0BWW476QB", "detailPageURL": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWW476QB", "itemInfo": {"title": {"displayValue": "White Ceramic Vase Set of 2 for Modern Home Decor, Round Boho Donut Vase for Pampas Grass, Neutral Minimalist Vase for Dining Room Table Centerpiece Dining Room, Living Room, Wedding Table Decoration"}, "classifications": {"productGroup": {"displayValue": "Ceramic Tea Set"}}, "byLineInfo": {"brand": {"displayValue": "XMGZQ"}}}, "browseNodeInfo": {"browseNodes": [{"id": "1001", "displayName": "Ceramic Tea Set"}]}, "offersV2": {"listings": [{"price": {"money": {"amount": 33.99, "currency": "USD"}}}]}, "customerReviews": {"starRating": 4.8, "count": 24.0}, "description": "Ceramic Vase Set of 2"}, {"asin": "B0BRM9QLW6", "detailPageURL": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRM9QLW6", "itemInfo": {"title": {"displayValue": "GreenPan Rio Healthy Ceramic Nonstick 16 Piece Cookware Pots and Pans Set, PFAS-Free, Dishwasher Safe, Turquoise & Rio Healthy Ceramic Nonstick 13.5\" Frying Pan Skillet, Turquoise"}, "classifications": {"productGroup": {"displayValue": "Ceramic Tea Set"}}, "byLineInfo": {"brand": {"displayValue": "GreenPan"}}}, "browseNodeInfo": {"browseNodes": [{"id": "1001", "displayName": "Ceram