et comes with a durable PVC pouch for protection and easy storage while not in use. Each tool features a grip so you'll be able to hold on to it with ease. Make sur"}, {"asin": "B0BGHQLPZY", "detailPageURL": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGHQLPZY", "itemInfo": {"title": {"displayValue": "Orenm Black and Silver Ceramic Vase 2 Piece Set Modern Home Decor Hollow Bohemian Vase Living Room Medium Table Wedding Decoration (Black+Silver)"}, "classifications": {"productGroup": {"displayValue": "Ceramic Tea Set"}}, "byLineInfo": {"brand": {"displayValue": "orenm"}}}, "browseNodeInfo": {"browseNodes": [{"id": "1001", "displayName": "Ceramic Tea Set"}]}, "offersV2": {"listings": [{"price": {"money": {"amount": 39.88, "currency": "USD"}}}]}, "customerReviews": {"starRating": 4.4, "count": 44.0}, "description": "Hollow Ceramic Vase Set of 2"}, {"asin": "B000BUES2A", "detailPageURL": "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BUES2A", "itemInfo": {"title": {"displayValue": "Fox Run Ceramic French Onion Soup Crock Bowls, Set of 2"}, "classifications": {"productGroup": {"displayValue": "Ceramic Tea Set"}}, "byLineInfo": {"brand": {"displayValue": "Fox Run"}}}, "browseNodeInfo": {"browseNodes": [{"id": "1001", "displayName": "Ceramic Tea Set"}]}, "offersV2": {"listings": [{"price": {"money": {"amount": 15.83, "currency": "USD"}}}]}, "customerReviews": {"starRating": 4.5, "count": 5.0}, "description": "Enjoy homemade French onion soup with this set of two microwaveable soup crocks. For use in conventional or microwave ovens, these bowls can go straight from oven to table for a beautiful presentation of your baked soup. The convenient handles make carrying a breeze, and the ceramic construction makes the bowls oven safe up to 350 degrees F.\n4-1/4\" diameter x 6\" L, with an 8 ounce capacity"}]}}